mpending threat of destruction. While he says he wants to protect the Earth, he says he's only come to warn them of the crisis, and that it's up to the five of them to decide whether or not they want to fight for the Earth...\n\nIsn't this just an attempt to dodge responsibility? The Defense Club members are suspicious. \"If either is fine with you, I'll do it! That's more fashionable!\" Unzen enthusiastically says. The five decide to fight with free will, and Nuru transforms them into the Haikara Romantic Troupe using feline science.\n\nMeanwhile, a mysterious trio called the Bankara New Elite Squad are scheming in the shadows. They are plotting to take over the Earth.\n\n(Source: Official site)\n\nNote: Relations is provisional and will be updated when more info is announced."},"tags":[{"name":"Parody","rank":85,"spoiler":false},{"name":"Henshin","rank":80,"spoiler":false},{"name":"Magic","rank":79,"spoiler":false},{"name":"Cute Boys Doing Cute Things","rank":79,"spoiler":false},{"name":"Animals","rank":79,"spoiler":false},{"name":"School","rank":79,"spoiler":false},{"name":"Nudity","rank":79,"spoiler":false},{"name":"Swordplay","rank":79,"spoiler":false},{"name":"LGBTQ+ Themes","rank":79,"spoiler":false},{"name":"Ninja","rank":79,"spoiler":false},{"name":"Time Manipulation","rank":79,"spoiler":true},{"name":"Meta","rank":79,"spoiler":false},{"name":"Anthropomorphism","rank":79,"spoiler":true},{"name":"Revenge","rank":79,"spoiler":true},{"name":"Primarily Male Cast","rank":73,"spoiler":false},{"name":"Super Power","rank":73,"spoiler":false},{"name":"Episodic","rank":73,"spoiler":false},{"name":"Male Protagonist","rank":60,"spoiler":false},{"name":"Historical","rank":60,"spoiler":false},{"name":"Boys' Love","rank":20,"spoiler":false},{"name":"Aliens","rank":10,"spoiler":false}],"titles":{"display":"Cute High Earth Defense Club Hi-CARA!","english":"Cute High Earth Defense Club Hi-CARA!","native":"美男高校地球防衛部ハイカラ！","romaji":"Binan Koukou Chikyuu Bouei-bu Haikara!","syn